  "content": {
    "component": "news_article",
    "_uid": "1667-root",
    "title": "Victoria Hall Wins RIBA National Award ",
    "subtitle": null,
    "summary": "Victoria Hall King's Cross has won RIBA National Award for architecture in 2018.",
    "media": [
      {
        "_uid": "656e639937b1560a",
        "component": "news_media",
        "role": "banner",
        "filename": "1667-BannerImage.jpg",
        "src": "/news-media/1667-BannerImage.jpg",
        "media_type": "image",
        "caption": null,
        "alt": "Victoria Hall Wins RIBA National Award"
      }
    ],
    "body": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Victoria Hall King's Cross",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "link",
                  "attrs": {
                    "href": "http://www.victoriahallkingscross.com/",
                    "target": "_blank",
                    "linktype": "url",
                    "uuid": null,
                    "anchor": null,
                    "custom": {}
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " has won RIBA National Award for architecture in 2018. The building was among 49 projects in the UK being awarded for their architectural excellence."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "RIBA",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "link",
                  "attrs": {
                    "href": "https://www.architecture.com/awards-and-competitions-landing-page/awards/riba-regional-awards/riba-london-award-winners/2018/victoria-hall-kings-cross",
                    "target": "_blank",
                    "linktype": "url",
                    "uuid": null,
                    "anchor": null,
                    "custom": {}
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "'s reflection on the building: \"The architect has raised the bar for the design quality of student residences where the immaculate detailing and high quality, natural finishes convey a sense of permanence as well as reference both the adobe architecture of the Middle East and the industrial heritage of King's Cross.\" "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Victoria Hall is student accommodation in the heart of King's Cross, London. It's an 11-storey building designed by award-winning London-based "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Stanton Williams ",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "link",
                  "attrs": {
                    "href": "https://www.stantonwilliams.com/",
                    "target": "_self",
                    "linktype": "url",
                    "uuid": null,
                    "anchor": null,
                    "custom": {}
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "architects. The building houses students from AKU-ISMC and others and has stylish communal spaces, which include a gym, reading room, meeting and A/V room and a lounge area."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Victoria Hall also has two outdoor spaces - a courtyard on the first floor and a terraced garden on the eighth floor, both designed by Vladimir Djurovic who also designed the Aga Khan Park in Toronto. "
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
